flowchart TD
    A[Customer enters store] --> B[Start Scan-and-Go session]
    B --> C[Scan product QR / barcode]
    C --> D[Backend validates product + stock]
    D --> E[Reserve stock]
    E --> F[Add item to cart]

    F --> G{Continue shopping?}
    G -->|Yes| C
    G -->|No| H[Checkout]

    H --> I[Mock / Sandbox payment]
    I --> J{Payment status}

    J -->|Failed| K[Release reservation]
    K --> L[Show payment failure / retry]

    J -->|Expired / Cancelled| M[Release reservation]
    M --> L

    J -->|Success| N[Confirm transaction]
    N --> O[Convert reservation to sale]
    O --> P[Update inventory]
    P --> Q[Generate digital receipt]
    Q --> R[Exit verification]

    R --> S{Receipt valid?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Customer exits]
    S -->|No| U[Assisted verification]
